{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>由 Yash Future Tech Solutions Pvt Ltd 發行的 Dark Mystery 現於 Epic Games 平台<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，支援 Windows，截止時間為 11 月 8 日 18:30（香港時間）。這是一款結合解謎與平台跳躍的作品，玩家要在充滿難題的關卡中尋找真愛，並可體驗 35 個具策略性的關卡與單螢幕雙人多人模式。</p>\n<p>遊戲背景圍繞玩家角色 Furry 與她的 Queen。Queen 迷失於暗黑世界，Furry 需要穿越不同難度的關卡，解開一道道腦力謎題，逐步找出真愛。玩法以解謎平台跳躍為核心，玩家要觀察環境、避開障礙並運用直覺操作前進；官方亦強調操作直觀、介面易用，難度會隨關卡推進而提升。</p>\n<p>除了主線解謎流程，遊戲提供 35 個不同策略關卡，並支援同一螢幕的 2 人多人遊玩，適合與朋友一同挑戰。隨著難度逐級增加，玩家需要動腦破解更多謎題，體驗以真愛與暗黑世界為題的冒險旅程。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】暗黑世界尋愛解謎 Dark Mystery 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-924c079b977042a2b1c4da03a92d6f9864742c3f-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】暗黑世界尋愛解謎 Dark Mystery 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-C6d3258ac18586005998dc6ec46606d81e7387d0-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】暗黑世界尋愛解謎 Dark Mystery 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-C2a37a3336aa858752785cf4b7b7e847b5702d68-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】暗黑世界尋愛解謎 Dark Mystery 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-4ec55d9a210e06e4d4370014d5c6400fb33b9da9-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Dark Mystery<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/dark-mystery-baf914\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:15.275844+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":456,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:25:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.736802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:41.660535+00:00","content_hash":"8d7c47a7d44321fcfa25bb886aa6aa6f9977683378a0bbdba21d216addc72a8a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:15.275844+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}